## SLI definition

> A good SLI is a ratio of good events to total valid events.

- **Good events:** _e.g. HTTP 2xx/3xx/4xx (excluding 401/403) responses with latency < {{ .LatencyTarget }}_
- **Valid events:** _e.g. all HTTP requests to /api/* excluding health checks_
- **Bad events:** _all valid events that are not good_

### PromQL example

```promql
sum(rate(http_requests_total{service="{{ .Service }}",code!~"5.."}[5m]))
/
